# --- Design vault ----------------------------------------------------------
# The design ships in full: this is a graded submission, and the design is part
# of what is being graded. `docs/PROTECTING-THE-FRONTEND.md` and
# `web/scripts/design-vault.mjs` still document and implement the encryption,
# and `npm run design:lock` still works -- it is simply not applied here.
#
# The key never ships. Nor do the encrypted blobs: `design-vault.mjs unlock`
# leaves the author's files alone only when there is no .enc beside them, so a
# repository carrying both would overwrite the real design with the neutral
# stand-ins the first time anybody ran `npm run build`.
web/.design-key
web/**/*.enc
web/design/fallbacks/

# --- Not part of the submission --------------------------------------------
# Personal recordings used while testing. These are somebody's actual voice and
# have no business in a public repository.
*.ogg
*.opus
WhatsApp*

# Rendered screenshots. Ten megabytes of build output that anybody can
# regenerate with `npm run shots`, and that nobody needs in order to run this.
web/shots/

# Database snapshots taken during development.
salix.db.demo-backup
*.db-backup

# Local AI assistant settings
.claude/
